<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.restore.reads ~ a restored face stands provisional until confirmed

`lares persona provisional <index>` reads whether a restored face still stands provisional, the head its restore read, and who could confirm it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ provisional

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`provisional` params=`index/1 ~ read face h1's restore standing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required seat/1 as/<index> ~ the face's handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the face's sealed restore record`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.restore.reads index/1]] ~ no index, or one out of range`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ read

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`read` params=`exit/0 ~ the provisional reading`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona provisional

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares persona provisional]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

